[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892211\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892286\">7065C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892172\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891960\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891963\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892291\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892101\">7010M16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891989\">5580E30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892173\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891934\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892134\">7025A24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892213\">7040L42</a>\n                                           (left and right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892170\">7040A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891764\">5010B24</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the actuator electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air intake actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890982\">N82</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the rubber anti-vibration seals.</p><p>4. Remove the actuator.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035326.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the actuator is\nnot damaged and, if necessary, conduct an electrical test on it.</p><p>Refit the actuator. The actuator shaft\nmust be in the correct position in the lever housing.</p><p>Position the new rubber anti-vibration\nseals.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p>Connect the actuator electrical connection.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891764\">5010B24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892170\">7040A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892213\">7040L42</a>\n                                           (left and right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892134\">7025A24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891934\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892173\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891989\">5580E30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892101\">7010M16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892291\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891963\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891960\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892172\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892286\">7065C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892211\">7040L20</a></p><p>Check that the components involved are\ncorrectly fitted and working properly.</p>"]]